  "中文": "English",
  "语言": "Language",
  "那天风很大，他裹着毯子，还是替一个陌生人问清了打印店的方向。": "The wind was brutal that day, wrapped in a blanket, he still stopped to ask for directions to the print shop for a total stranger.",
  "故事从一次笨拙的主动开始，那个绿色的小勾成了后来的入口。": "It all started with my clumsy first move, that tiny green WeChat checkmark later became the doorway to everything.",
  "他教会我对焦，也教会我可以为自己留下一片光。": "He taught me how to focus a camera, and taught me I could save a little patch of warm light just for myself.",
  "我隔着柜台认出了它，像认出他分享日常时的那种认真。": "I spotted it across the counter right away, just like recognizing the earnestness he brought to every little daily moment he shared.",
  "送出的只能是自己多余的线索；分享的分寸，从那时就开始了。": "I could only send spare clues of my own; even then, sharing came with its own boundaries.",
  "周三下午的公选课，让两个专业的人有了可以期待的交集。": "That Wednesday afternoon general elective wove two totally unrelated majors into a little anticipated weekly meetup.",
